{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nI arrived in Luxembourg this evening. Mr. von Hanfstengel showed me around the city and along the fortress walls; the fortifications are massive, but the air here is heavy. I have already secured the spot for the coach to Metz for tomorrow morning.\n\nOn the journey, a gentleman from Leuven sat next to me, who had just returned from a Rhine river cruise. He spoke with a quiet sorrow that deeply moved me: He has just lost a son of twenty-one and a daughter of seventeen years. The story reminds me that the individual is always subject to the universal, and how the freedom of the spirit in such moments collides with the harsh reality of death. He invited me to visit him in Leuven, which I gratefully declined, as my route to France compels me. I wish you and the boys all the best and kiss you.\n\nYour\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221250,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":193,"prompt_tokens":282,"total_tokens":475,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-kaWPpsQqk97zCuzrfksxovhP01tnWbFM","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":282,"prompt_ms":518.921,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.8401453900709221,"prompt_per_second":543.435320597933,"predicted_n":193,"predicted_ms":4508.056,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.47945833333333,"predicted_per_second":42.590420349702846}}